<title>NORWAY: TABLE-Norway July jobless rate rises to 3.6 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Norway July jobless rate rises to 3.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Labour directorate issued the following economic indicator.</p>
<p> NORWEGIAN UNEMPLOYMENT     JULY 1997  JUNE 1997  JULY 1996</p>
<p> Unemployment (in pct)	   3.6	  3.4	  4.7</p>
<p> Unemployed			 80,955     75,500    103,000</p>
<p>SEASONALLY ADJUSTED FIGURES</p>
<p> Unemployed			 73,358     75,536	N/A</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
